Package: rw
Version: 0.1.0-9002
Title: R API to the 'rw' CLI for webR
Description: Provides an R interface to run R code in a sandboxed WebAssembly
    (WASM) environment via Node.js and webR. The package wraps the 'rw' CLI
    tool, enabling secure evaluation of untrusted R code isolated from the
    host system.
